                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The data is collected via an app for self-scanning in physical supermarkets in the Netherlands. Data from the app was stored in a database. With a Query data was taken from the database and manually aggregated into the dataset deposited here. <br><br>\nRQs: Can digital JIT-delivered visibility nudges stimulate healthier food choices? And second, does providing an additional descriptive or evaluative nutritional labeling nudge result in a stronger effect on healthier food choice than the visibility nudge alone?"
                }
